rdict: `NO-GO`\n- exit code: non-zero\n- reason: the PR implementation bundle is not yet present on `origin/main`\n\n## Second-round trust-boundary remediation\n\nCommit `f7f48950fdf9d44adbccab2bf6152789350c4518` fixes the two remaining load-bearing issues.\n\n### Formal gate source\n\n- The formal CLI has no `--root`, `--source-ref`, synthetic resolver, or checkout switch.\n- Every repo-controlled formal input is read with the fixed `origin/main` Git resolver.\n- Missing or malformed origin/main artifacts fail closed.\n- Bundle hashes and scans use the loaded origin/main bytes, never same-path working-tree bytes.\n- Checkout verification uses the separate `validate_9709_campaign_a_parent_creation_gate_contract_v1.py` entrypoint.\n- The contract-test check remains `9709-parent-creation-gate-contract-tests`; it cannot become a formal admission check.\n\n### Independent review lifecycle\n\nThe receipt now binds `reviewed_implementation_sha`, not current HEAD.\n\nA valid lifecycle is:\n\n1. producer implementation commit I;\n2. independent reviewer reviews I and its exact artifact inventory;\n3. later receipt commit R lands the receipt;\n4. I must be a real commit object and an ancestor of current `origin/main`;\n5. current origin/main bytes and implementation-commit bytes must both equal every receipt hash.\n\nThe reviewed bundle covers 40 paths: workflow, package/requirements entrypoints, builder, shared validator, all real/synthetic CLIs, focused tests, contracts/schemas, manifest, fixtures, baseline/pointer, ACL/store/route/rollback receipts, and sampling commitments.\n\nExplicit exclusions:\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/pdf-first-rebuild/runs/parent-creation-gate-v1/independent-review-receipt.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/pdf-first-rebuild/runs/parent-creation-gate-v1/parent-creation-gate-receipt.v1.json`\n\nReceipt commit R therefore does not invalidate review of I. Changing any reviewed code, workflow, test, contract, or artifact does invalidate it. Editing the receipt to relabel changed bytes still fails against bytes at I.\n\n### Derived gate receipt lifecycle\n\nThe checked-in derived gate receipt was removed. Formal evaluation computes a runtime result from origin/main evidence. Optional `--write-receipt` accepts only an absolute repo-external, non-`/tmp`, existing-parent path. Builder `--check` rejects any reintroduced checked-in runtime receipt.\n\nThe lifecycle policy is machine-readable at `contracts/parent-creation-gate-receipt-lifecycle.v1.json`. Builder drift protection remains 26 deterministic artifacts.\n\n## Current external blockers after checkout contract validation\n\n- `e1_60_mainline_membership_commitment_not_verifiable`\n- `independent_review_pending_or_changes_required`\n- `owner_approved_repo_external_durable_root_and_readback_missing`\n- `role_access_acl:actual_campaign_principals_not_configured`\n- `role_access_acl:append_only_access_log_not_verified`\n\nNo boolean or synthetic fixture clears these blockers.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Focused pytest: **50 passed**\n- Builder drift check: **26 artifacts checked, pass**\n- Checkout active-manifest contract test: pass\n- Checkout ParentCreationGate contract test: pass with honest NO-GO\n- Formal ParentCreationGate: NO-GO / non-zero\n- Official active-manifest validator: non-zero until implementation is on origin/main\n- Synthetic parent-close contract test: pass; formal receipt emitted = false\n- Secret findings: 0\n- Holdout/Gold/raw material findings: 0\n- `git diff --check`: pass\n- Workspace after commit: clean\n\nTargeted lifecycle mutations cover dirty working-tree shadow bytes, formal CLI escape flags, missing/malformed origin/main artifacts, receipt-after-implementation ancestry, invalid/non-ancestor implementation commits, code/workflow/package/test/artifact drift, stale bundle hashes, self-authored and changes-required receipts, receipt relabel attempts, explicit receipt exclusions, and rejection of a checked-in runtime gate receipt.\n\n## Fixed boundaries\n\n- Campaign A not started\n- PaidExecutionGate not passed\n- provider calls = 0\n- remote Supabase writes = 0\n- Storage/Vector/RAG writes = 0\n- actual holdout selection = 0\n- Gold production = 0\n- accepted rows = 0\n- canonical promotion = 0\n- Campaign A issues created = 0\n- production/public display changes = 0\n- secrets/.env reads or uploads = 0\n","created_at":"2026-07-12T13:45:15Z","updated_at":"2026-07-12T15:05:14Z","closed_at":"2026-07-12T15:05:14Z","merged_at":"2026-07-12T15:05:14Z","merge_commit_sha":"93525b3e522dfd97883e96027dcf41f301e0f7fd","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1539/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1539/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1539/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/f7f48950fdf9d44adbccab2bf6152789350c4518","head":{"label":"Samsen879:codex/9709-parent-creation-gate","ref":"codex/9709-parent-creation-gate","sha":"f7f48950fdf9d44adbccab2bf6152789350c4518","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.g